#: ../../plugins.rst:165
msgid "Open the address printed by the server. The page says \"Hello Orbit.\" and has an Orbit badge. Its stylesheet is ``_static/plugins/product-badge/banner.css``. Change the configured name to ``Comet`` and build again. Both the text and badge change. A further unchanged build writes no output files."
